+    <!--end-logo-->
+
+    <h1>WebGL 2.0 Specification</h1>
+    <h2 class="no-toc">Editor's Draft <span id="LastEditDate"></span></h2>
+    <dl>
+        <dt>This version:
+            <dd>
+                <a href="https://www.khronos.org/registry/webgl/specs/latest/2.0/">
